  "limitations": [
    "MI paid generated conversions with replaced original remain paused; unpaid lookup waits for native recipe caches (~20s or longer with nested cache timers).",
    "MI changed or removed paid recipe pauses in current runtime. Native MI NBT stores ID/EU without the original codec fingerprint, so semantics across restart are not proven.",
    "Oritech Atomic Forge native fresh lookup may reset its RF buffer when existing contextual RecipeManager filtering yields empty. Cached selector filtering happens after polymorphic capacity adjustment to avoid introducing the same loss there.",
    "Oritech normal selection is guarded before energy use; defensive commit cancellation does not refund native RF/progress already spent. No universal energy preservation claim.",
    "No fullpack optional Mixin dispatch, Survival, JEI or TPS acceptance has been run."
  ],
  "independent_review": "Oritech method/descriptor and side-effect source review completed; no additional confirmed future-output route in the covered processors"
}
